; The QEMU guest agent runs with NoNewPrivileges=yes (ADR-0144,
; athanor-base-config's qemu-guest-agent.service.d/10-athanor.conf). Under no_new_privs the
; kernel refuses systemd's transition to Fedora's confined domain unless the policy grants
; nnp_transition, and the agent stays in init_t: measured on the Fedora 45 S1 guest on
; 2026-11-20, `ps -Z` read init_t without this rule and the agent was confined with it.
(allow init_t virt_qemu_ga_t (process2 (nnp_transition nosuid_transition)))
